1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

2
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

3
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">hikarabita kotoba wo tsunai de</font></font></b></font></font>

4
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">connecting old words that have<font color="#ffffff"> been used up</font></font></font></b></font></font>

5
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo bokura shinpuru na omoi wo tsutaetai dake na no</font></font></b></font></font>

6
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I just want to convey my simple thoughts</font></font></b></font></font>

7
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">fukinukeru kusunda ano hi no kaze wa</font></font></b></font></font>

8
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:34,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that day's faint wind blows away</font></font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kinou no haikyo ni uchi sutete</font></font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">at the castle ruins of yesterday</font></font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kimi to warau ima wo ikiru no da</font></font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I'll laugh with you and live for the moment</font></font></b></font></font>

13
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo ano dekigoto ga kimi wo kurushimeru daro</font></font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">still that incident will continue to trouble you, right?</font></font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">dakarakoso sayonara nanda</font></font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that's why it must be good-bye</font></font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">konomama nanimo nokorazu ni anata to wakachiau dake</font></font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">leaving nothing behind, let us share what is left</font></font></b></font></font>

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yagate bokura wa sore ga subetee dato kigatsuite</font></font></b></font></font>

20
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">in time, we'll realize that it was everything</font></font></b></font></font>

21
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:02:01,550 --> 00:02:03,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Coffin!</font>

26
00:02:06,930 --> 00:02:08,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do it.</font>

27
00:02:11,020 --> 00:02:13,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! Please back me up.</font>

28
00:02:19,660 --> 00:02:21,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got sand in my mouth...</font>

29
00:02:21,820 --> 00:02:23,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">P-Please let me go!</font>

30
00:02:29,460 --> 00:02:32,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You wouldn't be able to do
anything in your current state...</font>

31
00:02:33,130 --> 00:02:34,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do it.</font>

32
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:35,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please be careful!</font>

33
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:37,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy attacks with bones!</font>

34
00:02:44,010 --> 00:02:45,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like earlier...</font>

35
00:02:45,260 --> 00:02:48,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he does things like shoot bones
and extrude bones from inside his body...</font>

36
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:51,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He controls bones freely!</font>

37
00:02:52,190 --> 00:02:53,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara of the Desert...</font>

38
00:02:57,190 --> 00:02:59,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You use sand
as the name implies, huh...?</font>

39
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:11,120
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Showdown</font>

40
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:11,120
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">of</font>

41
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:11,120
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">the</font>

42
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:11,120
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Strongest!</font>

43
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:11,120
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Gaara vs Kimimaro!!</font>

44
00:03:17,460 --> 00:03:19,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tough defense using sand...</font>

45
00:03:21,300 --> 00:03:24,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He... isn't a close-range combat type...</font>

46
00:03:26,260 --> 00:03:29,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Getting close would be difficult, huh.</font>

47
00:03:37,610 --> 00:03:38,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's coming!</font>

48
00:03:40,150 --> 00:03:41,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Digital Shrapnel!</font>

49
00:03:57,420 --> 00:03:59,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no waste in his movements...</font>

50
00:03:59,380 --> 00:04:02,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough,
he's a considerable Taijutsu user.</font>

51
00:04:04,340 --> 00:04:05,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Attack and defense are one...</font>

52
00:04:05,930 --> 00:04:08,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He attacks and defends
with sand, huh?</font>

53
00:04:09,810 --> 00:04:13,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, the amount of sand
he can control is probably...</font>

54
00:04:14,060 --> 00:04:16,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...about the amount of sand
inside the gourd.</font>

55
00:04:17,020 --> 00:04:20,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara of the Desert...
A dopey nickname.</font>

56
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:26,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't do anything
if you don't have sand.</font>

57
00:04:28,490 --> 00:04:31,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Going to the trouble of walking around
carrying heavy sand</font>

58
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is the very proof of that.</font>

59
00:04:37,630 --> 00:04:39,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Shower...</font>

60
00:04:43,380 --> 00:04:44,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How trite...</font>

61
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:50,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as I have sand
I can do anything.</font>

62
00:04:51,060 --> 00:04:52,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the one who's dopey...</font>

63
00:04:53,180 --> 00:04:57,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's easy for me to do things
like create sand with dirt...</font>

64
00:04:58,860 --> 00:04:59,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it...</font>

65
00:05:00,270 --> 00:05:04,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With his own sand he grinds things
like rocks and minerals in dirt</font>

66
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:05,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and makes it into sand.</font>

67
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:09,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So he was sending his own sand
beneath the ground</font>

68
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:11,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and adding new sand, huh...?</font>

69
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara of the Desert...</font>

70
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His nickname isn't just for display.</font>

71
00:05:17,830 --> 00:05:18,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excellent!</font>

72
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did it!</font>

73
00:05:24,760 --> 00:05:25,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not yet.</font>

74
00:05:27,130 --> 00:05:29,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Burial!</font>

75
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:46,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm reminded of that man
when I look at that guy.</font>

76
00:05:46,860 --> 00:05:47,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

77
00:05:47,860 --> 00:05:50,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke!</font>

78
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:53,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He had the same eyes
as that guy...</font>

79
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The same eyes?</font>

80
00:05:56,370 --> 00:05:59,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wanting to verify the value
of one's own existence...</font>

81
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such eyes...</font>

82
00:06:07,630 --> 00:06:09,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

83
00:06:48,010 --> 00:06:49,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

84
00:06:55,510 --> 00:06:56,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke.</font>

85
00:06:57,560 --> 00:07:00,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're here, aren't you?!
At least answer me!</font>

86
00:07:08,780 --> 00:07:11,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's gotten into you?!</font>

87
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:58,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't hate the darkness...</font>

88
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:11,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The darkness is where
I was brought up...</font>

89
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:48,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why am I... in a place like this?</font>

90
00:08:49,590 --> 00:08:52,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did I do something wrong?</font>

91
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:01,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is there really God...?</font>

92
00:09:02,060 --> 00:09:06,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If there is, why confine me
in a place like this?</font>

93
00:09:12,150 --> 00:09:12,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's there?</font>

94
00:09:13,940 --> 00:09:17,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter who I am...
Get out!</font>

95
00:09:22,750 --> 00:09:26,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kimimaro, the time has come to use you...</font>

96
00:09:26,750 --> 00:09:27,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

97
00:09:28,170 --> 00:09:31,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For our sake,
for the Kaguya Clan...</font>

98
00:09:32,300 --> 00:09:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fight!</font>

99
00:09:38,180 --> 00:09:40,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... To fight.</font>

100
00:09:41,350 --> 00:09:42,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is...</font>

101
00:09:43,930 --> 00:09:46,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the only thing I can do now.</font>

102
00:10:11,210 --> 00:10:12,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No way...</font>

103
00:10:22,890 --> 00:10:24,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's quite some pressure...</font>

104
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:30,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I would've been flattened
just like that</font>

105
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:33,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">had I not made a membrane
of bone just below the skin.</font>

106
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:50,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bones... That guy's a monster too.</font>

107
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:52,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a troublesome body, isn't it?</font>

108
00:10:55,050 --> 00:10:56,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I underestimated you...</font>

109
00:10:56,880 --> 00:10:59,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I won't be caught by
your sand anymore.</font>

110
00:11:09,810 --> 00:11:12,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Tsunami!</font>

111
00:11:41,050 --> 00:11:43,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow... It's beyond
the scope of</font>

112
00:11:43,890 --> 00:11:46,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">escaping from the sand
or not getting caught...</font>

113
00:12:00,070 --> 00:12:02,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think it would change
the terrain itself...</font>

114
00:12:12,210 --> 00:12:14,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... You did it.</font>

115
00:12:14,170 --> 00:12:15,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not yet.</font>

116
00:12:18,300 --> 00:12:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Giant Sand Burial!</font>

117
00:12:29,390 --> 00:12:31,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-He's so strong...</font>

118
00:12:31,930 --> 00:12:35,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's gotten even stronger
than when he fought me.</font>

119
00:12:37,310 --> 00:12:39,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... this time for sure...</font>

120
00:12:41,110 --> 00:12:42,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a persistent guy...</font>

121
00:12:42,780 --> 00:12:43,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

122
00:12:48,580 --> 00:12:50,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm still... alive...</font>

123
00:12:51,290 --> 00:12:55,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then... There's still significance
for me to live.</font>

124
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:01,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From now we're going
to launch a night attack</font>

125
00:13:01,460 --> 00:13:02,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">on the Hidden Mist Village...</font>

126
00:13:03,220 --> 00:13:05,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As they are disconcerted
from that incident</font>

127
00:13:06,090 --> 00:13:09,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">now is the perfect time for us
to make them realize our ferocity!</font>

128
00:13:14,180 --> 00:13:19,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Make them realize the ferocity
of the Kaguya Clan!</font>

129
00:13:19,650 --> 00:13:21,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yeah!
— Right!</font>

130
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:25,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing, Kimimaro?
Get going!</font>

131
00:13:26,910 --> 00:13:28,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what to do...</font>

132
00:13:29,070 --> 00:13:31,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't need to think
deeply about it.</font>

133
00:13:31,580 --> 00:13:33,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go down to the Hidden Mist Village</font>

134
00:13:33,580 --> 00:13:35,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and kill every last person
you encounter!</font>

135
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:42,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just act on your instincts!</font>

136
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:52,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you of the Hidden Mist Village?</font>

137
00:13:58,100 --> 00:13:59,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

138
00:14:02,150 --> 00:14:04,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I see... Excuse me!</font>

139
00:14:11,030 --> 00:14:11,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haku?</font>

140
00:14:11,950 --> 00:14:15,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... no. It's nothing, Zabuza-san.</font>

141
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:18,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't have time to be stopping.
Let's hurry!</font>

142
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:20,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

143
00:14:25,170 --> 00:14:26,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He had the same eyes as I...</font>

144
00:14:27,590 --> 00:14:29,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before I met Zabuza-san...</font>

145
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:46,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it!</font>

146
00:14:49,610 --> 00:14:54,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a hasty one, aren't you?
I'm not from this village.</font>

147
00:15:01,710 --> 00:15:05,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The thing you are after is right there...</font>

148
00:15:05,460 --> 00:15:07,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now go.</font>

149
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:14,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems to have begun...</font>

150
00:15:16,100 --> 00:15:17,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Kaguya Clan...</font>

151
00:15:18,310 --> 00:15:23,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fools who can only find
their own path of life by fighting...</font>

152
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:25,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was long ago</font>

153
00:15:25,940 --> 00:15:29,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when a simple-minded group that
just enjoyed slaughtering was acceptable.</font>

154
00:15:30,110 --> 00:15:32,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With a governed organization
as an opponent</font>

155
00:15:32,280 --> 00:15:34,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they just become fools
rushing towards death</font>

156
00:15:34,410 --> 00:15:37,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if they fight only with power...</font>

157
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:43,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are we the only survivors...?</font>

158
00:15:44,290 --> 00:15:47,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems we're surrounded...</font>

159
00:15:47,130 --> 00:15:49,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The defense was tighter
than we thought.</font>

160
00:15:50,220 --> 00:15:51,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have no choice...</font>

161
00:15:51,680 --> 00:15:52,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now it's come to this,</font>

162
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:55,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">take along with you
every person you can!</font>

163
00:15:56,810 --> 00:15:59,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll have them entertain us
as much as possible!</font>

164
00:16:01,390 --> 00:16:03,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do I fight for...?</font>

165
00:16:03,650 --> 00:16:05,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What am I...?</font>

166
00:16:05,900 --> 00:16:09,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Without knowing anything
I just kept on fighting.</font>

167
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:12,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The time has come to use you...</font>

168
00:16:14,280 --> 00:16:15,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm needed...</font>

169
00:16:16,450 --> 00:16:19,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was the only thing
that got my body moving.</font>

170
00:16:19,910 --> 00:16:20,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...</font>

171
00:16:22,290 --> 00:16:24,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was also able to figure out that...</font>

172
00:16:24,880 --> 00:16:27,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I couldn't live if I didn't fight.</font>

173
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:43,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dawn broke...</font>

174
00:16:44,810 --> 00:16:46,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I learned that...</font>

175
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:49,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I myself was the only one
to survive.</font>

176
00:16:51,150 --> 00:16:53,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Again, I'm all alone...</font>

177
00:16:55,450 --> 00:16:59,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By myself I just wandered
aimlessly from place to place.</font>

178
00:17:04,790 --> 00:17:05,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...</font>

179
00:17:33,150 --> 00:17:35,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The flower from back then...?</font>

180
00:17:38,780 --> 00:17:41,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you blooming
in a place like this?</font>

181
00:17:43,620 --> 00:17:45,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why won't you answer?</font>

182
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:51,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're ignoring me too, huh?!</font>

183
00:17:52,090 --> 00:17:56,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way you'd be seen
by someone in a place like this yet you...!</font>

184
00:17:56,340 --> 00:17:57,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's enough...</font>

185
00:18:00,390 --> 00:18:04,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe... there's no significance to living.</font>

186
00:18:06,850 --> 00:18:09,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you might be able to
discover something interesting</font>

187
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:12,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by continuing to live... right?</font>

188
00:18:13,860 --> 00:18:17,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like how you discovered that flower...</font>

189
00:18:19,280 --> 00:18:22,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like how I discovered you.</font>

190
00:18:26,790 --> 00:18:29,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, let's go...</font>

191
00:18:36,970 --> 00:18:40,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Back then...
Orochimaru-sama said that but...</font>

192
00:18:42,220 --> 00:18:45,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">People are born with
some kind of significance.</font>

193
00:18:46,180 --> 00:18:51,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I think...
some kind of important mission.</font>

194
00:18:53,520 --> 00:18:55,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The mission for me...</font>

195
00:18:57,110 --> 00:19:01,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is to protect Orochimaru-sama
and his ambition.</font>

196
00:19:07,370 --> 00:19:08,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's... that?!</font>

197
00:19:19,220 --> 00:19:24,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come back, Sasuke!
Everyone's worried about you!</font>

198
00:19:28,480 --> 00:19:31,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...
It's so dark I can't see anything!</font>

199
00:19:33,150 --> 00:19:35,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got better eyes than me.</font>

200
00:19:38,190 --> 00:19:40,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke is in the darkness now...</font>

201
00:19:40,900 --> 00:19:42,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Neji?!</font>

202
00:19:42,860 --> 00:19:44,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll be unable to catch up
with Sasuke</font>

203
00:19:44,830 --> 00:19:46,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you stop in a place like this...</font>

204
00:19:47,160 --> 00:19:48,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji!</font>

205
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:56,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... You're right!
This isn't the time to stop.</font>

206
00:19:57,090 --> 00:20:02,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just wait! I'll take Sasuke
back home no matter what!</font>

207
00:20:08,680 --> 00:20:09,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

208
00:20:34,040 --> 00:20:35,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sand Coffin!</font>

209
00:20:56,980 --> 00:20:58,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That form...?!</font>

210
