<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#d3eca3">sore dake de boku wa ukarete shimau no sa</font></b></font></font></font>

227
00:21:45,460 --> 00:21:51,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#d3eca3">no wonder I get carried away by you</font></b></font></font></font>

228
