<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#a7cce8">hajimete kimi to shabetta</font></b></font></font></font>

251
00:22:25,000 --> 00:22:30,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Baqa"><font size="28"><b><font color="#a7cce8">for the first time I spoke to you</font></b></font></font></font>

252
00:22:38,210 --> 00:22:40,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'm saved. That's excellent.</font>

253
00:22:40,580 --> 00:22:42,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">To think you could do such a thing!</font>

254
00:22:42,460 --> 00:22:45,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">He was persistent
but this is the end...</font>

255
00:22:46,050 --> 00:22:48,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">He'll never come out again.</font>

256
00:22:48,680 --> 00:22:50,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Brainwashed by Orochimaru...</font>

257
00:22:50,390 --> 00:22:54,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It's not brainwashing!
That person understands me!</font>

258
00:22:56,180 --> 00:22:58,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What do you guys know?!</font>

259
00:22:58,890 --> 00:23:02,270
